# Static assets (Workers Static Assets): each scene's file and its media.
# Media rarely changes; files are small enough to recheck sooner. A scene's
# file is an Apron archive, whose media type is application/jsonl (apron-web
# ARCHIVE.md §1). Media may be read by any client's script, not only shown:
# apron-web fetches a voice message to draw its waveform, which needs CORS.
/*/scene.jsonl
  Content-Type: application/jsonl; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
/*.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/*.jpg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/*.mp3
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
